<title>ABU DHABI: Abu Dhabi signs crude oil supply MoU with Sinopec.</title>
<headline>Abu Dhabi signs crude oil supply MoU with Sinopec.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) and China National Petrochemical Corp (Sinopec) on Wednesday signed a memorandum of understanding to sell Sinopec half a million barrels of crude oil a month until the year 2000.</p>
<p>Wuli Li, the head of Sinopec's external cooperation department, told Reuters that the sales would start in June.</p>
<p>He is currently in Abu Dhabi as part of a visiting Chinese oil delegation.</p>
</text>
